# Game rules

- Online multiplayer. Matchmaking uses trophies.
- Competitive outcomes must be fair: no real-money power, boosts, or paywalled units that win games.
- Prefer server-authoritative or otherwise hard-to-cheat designs for combat, resources, and match results.
- Keep the experience suitable for 12+.
- Do not invent core mechanics (win conditions, resources, combat math) as if they were already decided. Propose options and wait for the user.
